usage: stock-data [-h]
                  {probe-daily,probe-minute,recover,acceptance-offline,collect-input,collect-due-inputs} ...

positional arguments:
  {probe-daily,probe-minute,recover,acceptance-offline,collect-input,collect-due-inputs}
    probe-daily         run one explicit provider capability probe
    probe-minute        run one explicit minute provider capability probe
    recover             repair canonical files and metadata after interruption
    acceptance-offline  run deterministic offline M1 acceptance evidence
    collect-input       collect or replay one configured input into candidate
                        files
    collect-due-inputs  plan one scheduler tick, or explicitly execute
                        candidate collection

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
